The values is a list of 3, 9, 20, 15, and 7.
The lefts is a list of 1, -1, 3, -1, and -1.
The rights is a list of 2, -1, 4, -1, and -1.
The queue is a list of 20 zeros.
Keep a shared averages as an empty list of text.
To render with total (a whole number) with count (a whole number).
The integer is total divided by count.
The rest is total modulo count.
The parts is an empty list of text.
The headtext is format whole number integer as text.
Place headtext into parts.
Place "." into parts.
For every digit from 0 to 4.
Set rest to rest times 10.
The piece is rest divided by count.
The pad is format whole number piece as text.
Place pad into parts.
Set rest to rest modulo count.
If digit is 4, The built is join parts with "", Place built into averages.

Set item 0 of queue to 0.
The head is 0.
The tail is 1.
The remaining is 1.
The nextcount is 0.
The total is 0.
The count is 0.
Repeat while remaining is more than 0.
The node is item head of queue.
Add 1 to head.
Subtract 1 from remaining.
Set total to total plus item node of values.
Add 1 to count.
The left is item node of lefts.
If left is at least 0, set item tail of queue to left, add 1 to tail, add 1 to nextcount.
The right is item node of rights.
If right is at least 0, set item tail of queue to right, add 1 to tail, add 1 to nextcount.
If remaining is 0, render with total with count, set total to 0, set count to 0, set remaining to nextcount, set nextcount to 0.

The line is join averages with ",".
Show line.
